      ⍝ Bugs28 #42 regression: decode overflowed to ∞ instead of
      ⍝ raising DOMAIN ERROR, letting a non-finite value into the
      ⍝ workspace -- unlike every scalar function (1E300×1E300 is
      ⍝ already DOMAIN ERROR). Fixed in Bif_F12_ENCODE_DECODE.cc's
      ⍝ decode_real()/decode_complex(): isfinite() check on the
      ⍝ accumulated Horner value before returning it.
